          ],
          "sourceTargetId": "page-43-q1-b"
        },
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y = 4x + 1$",
          "worked": "The rate of change is $m = 4$ matches per shape.\nWhen $x = 0$, $c = 5 - 4(1) = 1$.\nTherefore, the linear equation is $y = 4x + 1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
